    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 253 of the laws of 2004 amending the private housing\nfinance law relating to rehabilitated multiple dwellings acquired and\nreconveyed by the federal government, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S9412",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9412-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
       "alternate": false,
       "chamber": "SENATE",
       "districtCode": 31,
